  "content": "\n\n<p>这是我“100天凋灵风暴”系列中使用的整合包</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">注意：你需要使用 CurseForge 应用来安装此整合包（它会一并安装所需的模组）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;该整合包使用了 Cracker 的凋灵风暴模组，将凋灵风暴加入《我的世界》，并搭配了大量其他模组，如食物、探索和新生物群系。本整合包专为生存模式或硬核模式设计。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>例如：该整合包让探索变得更加有趣，因为现在有了更多的结构！如果你召唤出凋灵风暴，还会有东西在身后追赶你并摧毁世界，而你在逃跑的过程中也能通过探索获得食物。此外，末地的体验也比以前好得多。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">全部集数：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fk_06QeLxuk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-vqi26nF24w?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ke8cGn8mjGs?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TuNDrQGVuZw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kx9VES9Xrjc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ufzORMjmJR8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
